    "panzoom: text colors changed to WCAG AAA contrast (7:1) on Quarto's code background (#f3f5f6): #545454 -> #3b3b3b (darker than comments), #d91e18 -> #a31712, #a55a00 -> #7d4400, #008000 -> #006000, #696969 -> #525252, #00769e -> #005978"
